<span class="ltx_bibblock">URL <a href="https://doi.org/10.1109/ACCESS.2019.2942762" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://doi.org/10.1109/ACCESS.2019.2942762</a>.

